<title>HONG KONG: Tong Yang unit to set $126 FRN.</title>
<headline>Tong Yang unit to set $126 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tong Yang South East Asia has mandated CS First Boston, Export-Import Bank of Korea and Kookmin Bank to arrange a US$126 million floating rate note issue, bankers said.</p>
<p>The issuer is a wholly owned subsidiary of Tong Yang Cement.</p>
<p>Bankers said the instrument has a final maturity of five years with a put option in year three.</p>
<p>Pricing details are not yet available.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
